      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Two cases of sensory-motor neuropathy attributed to perhexilene maleate are described. The clinical and pathological features of perhexilene neuropathy are discussed. The use of perhexilene should be tempered with caution. Nerve conduction studies may be useful in confirming early neuropathy."},
